      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Maybe they should set a lower up limit for the upper most bone of the thumb.\nIf I remember correctly, this same issue normally happens with the default thumbs up animation too when not using Index controllers, most people use a gesture override to get around this, the same applies for the sometimes 'claw' like fist animation.\nI don't think this issue is totally Index-specific, but I guess with no option to override the gestures we need to look into rig fixes for this now. :p",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
